--- a/packages/corgispec/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/packages/corgispec/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -2,6 +2,23 @@
 
 All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.
 
+## [Unreleased]
+
+### Added
+
+- Add `ARCHIVE_DELTA_COMPATIBLE` to deterministic readiness so a `MODIFIED` requirement cannot silently omit current
+  canonical scenario identities and fail only during Archive.
+- Add `archive --request-repair --reason <text>` to roll back only reproducible evidence and a pending pre-closeout
+  journal before creating a formal repair successor.
+
+### Changed
+
+- Make Archive begin consume the same compatibility check through lifecycle readiness, while allowing the repair
+  request to preserve binding and recover a known-bad plan without requiring that plan to pass the new check.
+- Make the Archive skill honor project-local PR/MR integration gates after local closeout: synchronize the exact
+  archive commit while the Run remains `archiving`, and defer tracker closeout, finish, and worktree removal until the
+  guarded finalizer confirms the required merge.
+
